{"id":"5c333dbc176d20e8","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-reflexive-theory.md","title":"Reflexive and Essentially Reflexive Theories","display":"df-reflexive-theory — Reflexive and Essentially Reflexive Theories","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-reflexive-theory","aliases":["67-df-reflexive-theory"],"display":"df-reflexive-theory — Reflexive and Essentially Reflexive Theories","depends_on":["[[67-df-finite-subtheory]]","[[67-df-prim-provability]]"],"source_scope":"第 1 章，印刷页 18–19，Corollary 8 前定义；PDF 第 29–30 页","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"不适用（定义）","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-reflexive-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-reflexive-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-reflexive-theory — Reflexive and Essentially Reflexive Theories"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"650dc4b8018183d7\" href=\"?note=650dc4b8018183d7\" title=\"67-df-finite-subtheory\">67-df-finite-subtheory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 1 章，印刷页 18–19，Corollary 8 前定义；PDF 第 29–30 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"不适用（定义）"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是在固定代码与证明演算下呈现的算术公理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{T\\upharpoonright k}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_{T\\upharpoonright k}\\)</span> 与代码有界片段取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"650dc4b8018183d7\" href=\"?note=650dc4b8018183d7\" title=\"67-df-finite-subtheory\">67-df-finite-subtheory</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq U\">\\(T\\subseteq U\\)</span> 表示在同一语言中的公理扩张；扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 的量词在本定义中不限制为递归集。每个有限片段的一致性句由有限枚举表示。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Reflexive}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Reflexive}(T)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EssReflexive}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{EssReflexive}(T)\\)</span> 在下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Reflexive}(T)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\ (T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{T\\upharpoonright k}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EssReflexive}(T)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\ (T\\subseteq U\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Reflexive}(U)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Reflexive}(T)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\ (T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{T\\upharpoonright k}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EssReflexive}(T)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\ (T\\subseteq U\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Reflexive}(U)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>反身性逐个要求标准有限公理片段的一致性可证；它不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 证明其自身全体公理的一致性。来源第 19 页 Corollary 8 断言 PA 本质反身，证明使用有限句子合取的部分真定义；该证明的文本已读，未把它改写为机器证明。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，本次用户提供 PDF；第 1 章，印刷页 18–19，Corollary 8 前定义；PDF 第 29–30 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：不适用（定义）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-finite-subtheory","status":"resolved","id":"650dc4b8018183d7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-finite-subtheory]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-prim-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-finite-subtheory","status":"resolved","id":"650dc4b8018183d7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 是在固定代码与证明演算下呈现的算术公理集，$\\mathrm{Con}_{T\\upharpoonright k}$ 与代码有界片段取 [[67-df-finite-subtheory]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_{T\\upharpoonright k}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq U","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Reflexive}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EssReflexive}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Reflexive}(T)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\ (T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{T\\upharpoonright k}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EssReflexive}(T)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\ (T\\subseteq U\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Reflexive}(U)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1875,"backlinks":[{"id":"f2048e5139e9d29b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9dc79b4dfd8280cb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8b478f37907667f0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0e1be9cc9d25b13b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-reflexive-theory]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-83","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-reflexive-theory]]"}],"outgoing":["650dc4b8018183d7","573b4c635ea6d91f"]}